      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "マグナス台地から見る夕日が綺麗なんじゃが\n最近は気性の荒い動物どもが跋扈しておってのう。\nとても夕日なんぞ見ておれる状況ではない。\n誰か追っ払ってくれんかのう……",
        "official_en": "The sunsets from the Magnus Plateau are beautiful,\nbut aggressive animals have been running rampant\nthere recently. Can't enjoy the sunsets until they're\ngone. I wonder if someone would chase them away...",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
