      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "動物どもを追っ払ってくれたのか！\n若いくせに、中々やるのう！\nばあさんと逢い引きをした思い出の場所でのう。\nこれでまたあの夕日をゆっくり拝めるわい。",
        "official_en": "You drove those animals away! My, you're young, but\nas capable as they come! That place is where my\nwife and I had our first date. Now... I can enjoy those\nsunsets again. Thank you...",
        "real_en": null
      },
